 },
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Risk Analytics & Multi-Asset Argentina\n\n## Motor cuantitativo de riesgo de mercado - Proyecto de presentación\n\nEste notebook presenta el motor cuantitativo construido como **REST API (FastAPI)** para evaluar riesgos de mercado y realizar pruebas de estrés sobre una cartera expuesta a factores macro de Argentina.\n\n### Activos del portafolio\n\n| Ticker | Descripción | Rol |\n|--------|-------------|-----|\n| `ZS=F` | Futuros de Soja (Chicago) | Flujo de divisas comerciales del agro |\n| `BZ=F` | Petróleo Brent | Factor energético y logístico global |\n| `YPF` | YPF S.A. | Proxy de renta variable argentina y riesgo país |\n| `BTC-USD`, `ETH-USD`, `SOL-USD`, `XRP-USD`, `BNB-USD` | Criptoactivos | Diversificación alternativa |\n\n---\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0) Imports y configuración\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "from app.services.data_engine import DataEngine\n",
    "from app.services.risk_engine import RiskEngine\n",
    "from app.services.stress_testing import StressTesting\n",
    "from app.services.monte_carlo import MonteCarloSimulator\n",
    "from app.services.portfolio import Portfolio\n",
    "from app.core.config import settings\n",
    "from app.core.logging import setup_logging\n",
    "\n",
    "setup_logging()\n",
    "print(f\"Configuración cargada: {settings.PROJECT_NAME} v{settings.VERSION}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Tickers por defecto: {settings.DEFAULT_TICKERS}\")\n"
   ],
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 1) Descarga de datos multi-asset (Parte 1 del proyecto)\n\nDescargamos precios históricos de los tres activos clave usando `descargar_datos_multiasset()` con caché local y fallback determinista.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "engine = DataEngine(cache_dir=\"data/cache\", enabled=True)\n",
    "precios = engine.descargar_datos_multiasset(\n",
    "    tickers=[\"ZS=F\", \"BZ=F\", \"YPF\"],\n",
    "    start=\"2020-01-01\",\n",
    "    end=\"2026-08-01\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Dimensiones:\", precios.shape)\n",
    "print(\"Columnas:\", list(precios.columns))\n",
    "display(precios.tail(10))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 2) Análisis de correlación y volatilidad (Parte 2 del proyecto)\n\nCalculamos retornos diarios, matriz de correlación y volatilidad anualizada.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "retornos = RiskEngine.retornos_diarios(precios)\n",
    "\n",
    "matriz_corr = retornos.corr()\n",
    "print(\"\\nMatriz de correlación de retornos diarios:\")\n",
    "display(matriz_corr.round(4))\n",
    "\n",
    "vol = RiskEngine.volatilidad_anualizada(retornos)\n",
    "print(\"\\nVolatilidad anualizada por activo:\")\n",
    "display((vol * 100).round(2).to_frame(\"Volatilidad %\"))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 6))\n",
    "for col in precios.columns:\n",
    "    ax.plot(precios.index, precios[col], label=col, linewidth=2)\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Precios históricos - Activos Multi-Asset Argentina\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Fecha\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Precio (USD)\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ],
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 3) Motor de riesgo: VaR, Expected Shortfall y Drawdown (Parte 3 del proyecto)\n\nCalculamos Value at Risk histórico y paramétrico al 95%, Expected Shortfall y Maximum Drawdown.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "confianza = 0.95\n",
    "\n",
    "var_hist = RiskEngine.var_historico(retornos, confianza=confianza)\n",
    "var_param = RiskEngine.var_parametrico(retornos, confianza=confianza)\n",
    "es = RiskEngine.expected_shortfall(retornos, confianza=confianza)\n",
    "mdd = RiskEngine.max_drawdown(precios)\n",
    "\n",
    "resumen_riesgo = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"VaR Histórico 95%\": var_hist * 100,\n",
    "    \"VaR Paramétrico 95%\": var_param * 100,\n",
    "    \"Expected Shortfall 95%\": es * 100,\n",
    "    \"Max Drawdown\": mdd * 100,\n",
    "}).round(2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nResumen de riesgo (confianza={confianza}):\")\n",
    "display(resumen_riesgo)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 4) Pruebas de estrés - Escenarios macro argentinos\n\nEjecutamos cuatro escenarios determinísticos:\n\n1. **Devaluación cambiaria 25%** (tipo Argentina)\n2. **Shock de soja -15%**\n3. **Shock de petróleo -20%**\n4. **Crisis conjunta histórica** (peor día desde 2020)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "st = StressTesting(precios=precios, retornos=retornos)\n",
    "resultados_estres = st.ejecutar_todos()\n",
    "\n",
    "for nombre, pnl_serie in resultados_estres.items():\n",
    "    pnl_cartera = st.pnl_cartera_igual(pnl_serie)\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n=== {nombre} ===\")\n",
    "    print(pnl_serie.round(4))\n",
    "    print(f\"P&L cartera igual ponderada: {pnl_cartera:.4f}\")\n"
   ],
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(14, 10))\n",
    "axes = axes.flatten()\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, (nombre, pnl_serie) in enumerate(resultados_estres.items()):\n",
    "    ax = axes[i]\n",
    "    pnl_serie.dropna().plot(kind=\"bar\", ax=ax, color=\"steelblue\", alpha=0.8)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(nombre.replace(\"_\", \" \").title(), fontsize=12)\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel(\"P&L (USD)\", fontsize=10)\n",
    "    ax.tick_params(axis=\"x\", rotation=45)\n",
    "    ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis=\"y\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 5) Simulación de Monte Carlo (10,000 escenarios)\n\nEjecutamos simulación con bootstrap histórico (resampleo de retornos observados) y GBM para comparar.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "sim = MonteCarloSimulator(precios=precios, retornos=retornos, seed=settings.RANDOM_SEED)\n",
    "\n",
    "precios_boot = sim.simular_bootstrap(days=1, n_scenarios=settings.MONTE_CARLO_SCENARIOS)\n",
    "precios_actuales = precios.iloc[-1]\n",
    "resumen_pnl = sim.resumen_pnl(precios_boot, precios_actuales)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== Monte Carlo Bootstrap (10,000 escenarios, 1 día) ===\")\n",
    "for clave, valor in resumen_pnl.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"{clave}: {valor:.4f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "pnl_dist = precios_boot.subtract(precios_actuales.values, axis=1).sum(axis=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n",
    "ax.hist(pnl_dist, bins=50, alpha=0.7, color=\"steelblue\", edgecolor=\"black\")\n",
    "ax.axvline(resumen_pnl[\"p5_pnl\"], color=\"red\", linestyle=\"--\", label=f\"P5: {resumen_pnl['p5_pnl']:.2f}\")\n",
    "ax.axvline(resumen_pnl[\"p50_pnl\"], color=\"green\", linestyle=\"--\", label=f\"Mediana: {resumen_pnl['p50_pnl']:.2f}\")\n",
    "ax.axvline(resumen_pnl[\"p95_pnl\"], color=\"orange\", linestyle=\"--\", label=f\"P95: {resumen_pnl['p95_pnl']:.2f}\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Distribución de P&L de la cartera - Monte Carlo Bootstrap (10k escenarios)\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"P&L (USD)\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Frecuencia\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 6) Métricas de cartera igual ponderada\n\nCalculamos Sharpe, Sortino, Maximum Drawdown, Calmar Ratio, VaR 95% y Expected Shortfall de la cartera.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "n_activos = len(precios.columns)\n",
    "pesos_iguales = {col: 1.0 / n_activos for col in precios.columns}\n",
    "\n",
    "port = Portfolio(retornos=retornos, precios=precios)\n",
    "metricas = port.metricas(pesos=pesos_iguales)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== Métricas de cartera (igual ponderada 1/3 cada activo) ===\")\n",
    "for clave, valor in metricas.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"{clave}: {valor}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nPesos: {pesos_iguales}\")\n"
   ],
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 7) Precios cripto (activos alternativos adicionales)\n\nDescargamos precios de criptomonedas como anexo al análisis multi-asset.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "cripto = engine.descargar_cripto(\n",
    "    tickers=[\"BTC-USD\", \"ETH-USD\", \"SOL-USD\", \"XRP-USD\", \"BNB-USD\"],\n",
    "    period=\"3mo\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Dimensiones cripto:\", cripto.shape)\n",
    "print(\"Columnas:\", list(cripto.columns))\n",
    "display(cripto.tail(5))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n\n## 8) Resumen ejecutivo\n\n| Métrica | Valor |\n|---------|-------|\n| Activos analizados | ZS=F, BZ=F, YPF (+ 5 cripto) |\n| Periodo | 2020-01-01 a 2026-08-01 |\n| VaR Histórico 95% (YPF) | Ver celda 3 |\n| Expected Shortfall 95% (YPF) | Ver celda 3 |\n| Escenarios de estrés | 4 (FX 25%, soja -15%, oil -20%, crisis histórica) |\n| Simulaciones Monte Carlo | 10,000 (bootstrap) |\n| Semilla aleatoria | 42 (reproducible) |\n| API REST | FastAPI en `http://localhost:8000` |\n| Documentación OpenAPI | `openapi.yaml` |\n\n---\n\n*Proyecto desarrollado para la cohorte 2026 — Risk Analytics & Multi-Asset Argentina.*\n"
   ]
  }
 ]
}